Current policy and reproducibility additions (2026-10-16):
The post-field policy/verification wrappers, fixed direction fixture generator,
portable workflow controller, periodic topology and contour geometry routines
are project-authored GPL-3.0-only additions. They call or interpret the retained
BORIS-derived rational SD/BB implementation; static_stop_policy.hpp does not
replace upstream attribution. Historical initial-direction conventions and
limits are documented; no user script or OVF is redistributed. Current file
origins and changed public hashes are recorded in docs/PROVENANCE.json and the
complete per-file license map. C1 only suppresses unconsumed diagnostics in the
combined evaluator; default standalone diagnostics and physics remain intact.

CPU delivery addition (2026-10-16):
local_field_team.hpp is a project-authored GPL-3.0-only ownership/synchronization
implementation of the retained local-field expressions. It does not replace
the BORIS-derived SD/BB code or its attribution. Main retains H_A and the
original E/Ecross reduction order; one persistent helper owns H_B. Both read
the same coupled state. The scientific reference sources above remain intact.
The demagnetization-extrapolation research reference is Lepadatu (2022),
DOI 10.1109/TMAG.2022.3159849; that approximate method is not enabled or bundled
as an executable candidate in this delivery.
